OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after collapse
OL,4,Anear development site
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents remain unable to return home
OL,7,Fdays after the frontage of two houses
OL,8,Fcollapsed in south-east London, with
OL,9,Fone resident saying he had raised
OL,10,Fconcerns about heavy vibration from
OL,11,Fnearby development works and requested
OL,12,Fthat work be paused.
OL,14,FThe partial collapse happened on
OL,15,FWoodland Terrace in Charlton at about
OL,16,F18:30 BST on Saturday.
OL,18,FThe terrace sits between the former
OL,19,FMorris Walk and Maryon Grove estates,
OL,20,Fwhich are being redeveloped as part of
OL,21,FGreenwich Council's Woolwich Estates
OL,22,Fregeneration project.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
