OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after collapse
OL,4,Anear development site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLovell, the developer carrying out the
OL,7,Fwork, said the cause of the collapse
OL,8,Fhad not been established and it would
OL,9,Fbe inappropriate to speculate while
OL,10,Finvestigations continued.
